        "title": "3D First-Person Pac-Man",
        "start_date": "Dec 2025",
        "description": "A 3D first-person Pac-Man game (Three.js, TypeScript, Vite) with dual-camera rendering (main view + minimap) in a single render pass. Implemented post-processing pipeline with dynamic bloom effects, procedural environment maps for real-time reflections, spatial audio, and ghost AI with pathfinding across multiple behavioral states."
